    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": ", and it is evident from the FIR itself that informant has 2 Katha 18 dhur land and petitioner no. 1 has sold only 4 dhur of the total land, meaning thereby petitioner no. 1 has not sold land of informant, but rather he has sold his share of land.",
